      "operation": "Homological agreement; Track how logos, measure, number and technē change their work across actual texts and their reception.",
      "evidence_register": 3,
      "canonical_home": "submission-package/essay/symbolon/episteme/histories/ancient-philosophy/HISTORY.md",
